OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Ffine evening to come with plenty of
OL,7,Flate sunshine. Overnight some cloud
OL,8,Fwill build, especially across the
OL,9,Fnorth and west of the region. A rather
OL,10,Fmild night ahead.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FSome patchy cloud in places
OL,13,Finitially but this will gradually
OL,14,Fclear, leaving a fine and sunny day
OL,15,Facross the region. Feeling a little
OL,16,Fcooler but still warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
